    "question": "উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ করঃ a² − 1 + 2b − b²",
    "steps": [
      "a² − 1 + 2b − b²",
      "= a² − (b² − 2b + 1)",
      "= a² − (b−1)²",
      "= {a + (b−1)}{a − (b−1)}",
      "= (a+b−1)(a−b+1)"
    ],
    "answer": "(a+b−1)(a−b+1)"
  },
  {
    "id": "job-2025-primary-mass-edu-office-asst-typist-q13",
